    "Define financial terminal-state invariants once, with dedicated settlement as sole writer of Paid; generic metadata transitions cannot substitute for ledger/treasury transactions. Preserve role separation and source-balance lock.",
    "Future pay/cancel coordination needs a shared run-state concurrency boundary, not just dedupe journal or client button gates.",
    "Add denied generic Paid transition and disposable provider pay/cancel barrier tests while retaining sequential/concurrent pay replay controls."
  ],
